   329→    description: |
   330→      YAML has pitfalls (Norway problem, type coercion).
   331→      These conventions ensure safe, predictable parsing.
   332→    requirements:
   333→      - _ulid: 01KEZCJPJ3Z9T0AWQGEJ3GW2WZ
   334→        slugs:
   335→          - yaml-version
   336→        title: YAML 1.2 Required
   337→        type: requirement
   338→        status:
   339→          maturity: draft
   340→          implementation: not_started
   341→        description: |
   342→          Parsers MUST use YAML 1.2 (not 1.1).
   343→          YAML 1.1 has dangerous implicit typing:
   344→          - "NO" -> false
   345→          - "on" -> true
   346→          - "3.14" might become float
   347→
   348→          YAML 1.2 is stricter and safer.
   349→        implements:
   350→          - '@yaml-conventions'
   351→      - _ulid: 01KEZCJPJ3MFX4H51TN64GEB6T
   352→        slugs:
   353→          - yaml-quoting
   354→        title: Quote Ambiguous Strings
   355→        type: requirement
   356→        status:
   357→          maturity: draft
   358→          implementation: not_started
   359→        description: |
   360→          Strings that might be misinterpreted MUST be quoted:
   361→          - "NO", "YES", "true", "false", "on", "off"
   362→          - Numbers that should be strings: "3.14", "1.0"
   363→          - Special values: "null", "~"
   364→
   365→          The linter should catch unquoted ambiguous values.
   366→        implements:
   367→          - '@yaml-conventions'
   368→      - _ulid: 01KEZCJPJ3M7T6ZNEMTVYBWP96
   369→        slugs:
